Subject: [PATCH 1136/3799] soh: rename func_808934B0 ->
 BgJyaAmishutter_SetupWaitForPlayerLeave

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: installs the action that holds the shutter open.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Amishutter/z_bg_jya_amishutter.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Amishutter/z_bg_jya_amishutter.c     | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Amishutter/z_bg_jya_amishutter.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Amishutter/z_bg_jya_amishutter.c
